    "name": "Is Converting Your Garage to an ADU the Right Choice for Your San Diego Property?",
    "text": "Is Converting Your Garage to an ADU the Right Choice for Your San Diego Property?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "A garage-to-ADU conversion may be a strong option when the existing structure is sound and its location supports an independent living unit, but the answer depends on more than available floor area. Compare the garage’s condition, utility routes, ceiling height, natural light, access, privacy, parking implications, and required upgrades with the cost and complexity of building a separate addition.",
